@jtagcat I appreciate the points you're making.

I'd love to see what an integration of [harg](https://github.com/jtagcat/harg/) for the purpose of addressing this issue looks like, if you're up for doing that work.

I'm personally interested in exploring [this approach](https://github.com/urfave/cli/pull/1584), if only to better understand how the urfave/cli layer can change.
